cui-q-9a7e360ceb18495ac113","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-2117c62bc68d4cf2728e","layer":"original","quote":"散骑常侍刘劭作《考课论》，制下百僚。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18},{"id":"huanchen-q-b5a7a81294e5f5535c14","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-2f3e1c8756bc32aa09dd","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年，入为侍中。先是，散骑常侍刘劭受诏定律〖10〗，未就。毓上论古今科律之意，以为“法宜一正〖11〗，不宜有两端，使奸吏得容情","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":542,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65},{"id":"wangwei-q-0490221bb36b64ed0926","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-5b1a429649aafac04e58","layer":"original","quote":"建安中，为计吏〖2〗，诣许","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":323,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":29},{"id":"wangwei-q-051984a5c0fc464a37d8","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-e374736b8c99de8c67f0","layer":"original","quote":"时散骑常侍刘劭作《考课法》，事下三府","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":422,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18},{"id":"wangwei-q-05adcdd7cd2e3b686acb","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-7d66831023b4429e3a53","layer":"original","quote":"时诏书博求众贤。散骑侍郎夏侯惠荐劭曰〖20〗：“伏见常侍刘劭：深忠笃思，体周于数〖21〗；凡所错综〖22〗，源流弘远；是以群才大小，咸取所同而斟酌焉。故性实之士服其平和良正；清静之人慕其玄虚退让；文学之士嘉其推步详密〖23〗，法理之士明其分数精比〖24〗；意思之士知其沉深笃固〖25〗；文章之士爱其著论属辞；制度之士贵其化略较要；策谋之士赞其明思通微。凡此诸论，皆取适己所长而举其支流者也。臣数听其清谈〖26〗，览其笃论〖27〗，渐渍历年，服膺弥久〖28〗，实为朝廷奇其器量。以为若此人者，宜辅翼机事，纳谋帏幄；当与国道俱隆，非世俗所常有也。惟陛下垂优游之听〖29〗，使劭承清闲之欢〖30〗，得自尽于前〖31〗；则德音上通，辉耀日新矣。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":351,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":322},{"id":"wangwei-q-0be99f90f15448696daf","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-aa19c53218e540c9c8f9","layer":"original","quote":"凡所撰述，《法论》、《人物志》之类百余篇〖9〗。","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":388,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":42},{"id":"wangwei-q-1130bd9947bf6b0d2565","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-cf24c7d325b9a4032fe9","layer":"original","quote":"迁秘书郎","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":325,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":27,"end":31},{"id":"wangwei-q-12852f0a0fc1f01121b1","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-512ad972d892624d9ffe","layer":"original","quote":"黄初中，为尚书郎、散骑侍郎","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":345,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13},{"id":"wangwei-q-1d839a4edad618c08f47","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-e374736b8c99de8c67f0","layer":"original","quote":"时散骑常侍刘劭作《考课法》，事下三府〖5〗。嘏难劭论曰〖6〗：","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":422,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31},{"id":"wangwei-q-235d6dfae60a97bbd844","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-5eac5c7994b5c57f5334","layer":"original","quote":"昔先王之择才〖38〗，必本行于州闾〖39〗，讲道于庠序〖40〗；行具而谓之贤，道修则谓之能。乡老献贤能于王〖41〗，王拜受之：举其贤者，“出使长之〖42〗”；科其能者，“入使治之”。此先王收才之义也。方今九州之民〖43〗，爰及京城，未有六乡之举；其选才之职，专任吏部〖44〗。按品、状〖45〗，则实才未必当；任（薄）〔簿〕伐，则德行未为叙〖46〗。如此则殿最之课〖47〗，未尽人才。述综王度〖48〗，敷赞国式〖49〗；体深义广，难得而详也。","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":220},{"id":"wangwei-q-3148be3cf15e29868f33","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-c5a68c8975d950778174","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：昔文帝、陈王以公子之尊〖1〗，博好文采；同声相应，才士并出，惟粲等六人最见名目〖2〗。而粲特处常伯之官〖3〗，兴一代之制；然其冲虚德宇〖4〗，未若徐幹之粹也。卫觊亦以多识典故，相时王之式〖5〗。刘劭该览学籍，文质周洽。刘廙以清鉴著〖6〗，傅嘏用才达显云〖7〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":558,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":136},{"id":"wangwei-q-3dfd9f69f44f4f525173","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-5b1a429649aafac04e58","layer":"original","quote":"刘劭字孔才，广平邯郸人也〖1〗。建安中，为计吏〖2〗，诣许〖3〗。太史上言〖4〗：“正旦当日食〖5〗。”劭时在尚书令荀彧所〖6〗；坐者数十人，或云“当废朝〖7〗”，或云“宜却会”。劭曰：“梓慎、裨灶〖8〗，古之良史，犹占水火错失天时〖9〗。《礼记》曰：‘诸侯旅见天子〖10〗，（及）〔入〕门不得终礼者四〖11〗。’日食在一。然则圣人垂制，不为变〔异〕预废朝礼者〖12〗；或灾消异伏，或推术谬误也〖13〗。”","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":323,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":203},{"id":"wangwei-q-3e0f8f2753f9640c4d52","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-5b1a429649aafac04e58","layer":"original","quote":"坐者数十人，或云“当废朝〖7〗”，或云“宜却会”。劭曰：“梓慎、裨灶〖8〗，古之良史，犹占水火错失天时〖9〗。《礼记》曰：‘诸侯旅见天子〖10〗，（及）〔入〕门不得终礼者四〖11〗。’日食在一。然则圣人垂制，不为变〔异〕预废朝礼者〖12〗；或灾消异伏，或推术谬误也","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":323,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":65,"end":197},{"id":"wangwei-q-46d87a4e25613ed7c1b4","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-aeb0d2f31c6e13a1c11b","layer":"original","quote":"征拜骑都尉","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":22,"end":27},{"id":"wangwei-q-48302efc7ad89bc197d0","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-27f1b7765a71073c8a41","layer":"original","quote":"劭上疏曰：“百官考课〖1〗，王政之大较〖2〗，然而历代弗务〖3〗；是以治典阙而未补，能否混而相蒙〖4〗。陛下以上圣之宏略，愍王纲之弛颓〖5〗，神虑内鉴，明诏外发。臣奉恩旷然〖6〗，得以启矇，辄作《都官考课》七十二条，又作《说略》一篇。臣学寡识浅，诚不足以宣畅圣旨，著定典制","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":386,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":150},{"id":"wangwei-q-4ad9bca45eb1c4491c99","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-aeb0d2f31c6e13a1c11b","layer":"original","quote":"著《律略论》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":59,"end":65},{"id":"wangwei-q-4cae0e2f8a3d5ce082d1","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-27f1b7765a71073c8a41","layer":"original","quote":"景初中，受诏作《都官考课》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":386,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13},{"id":"wangwei-q-5a18743db724d44d1494","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-aa19c53218e540c9c8f9","layer":"original","quote":"卒，追赠光禄勋","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":388,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":42,"end":49},{"id":"wangwei-q-6005731b71e6849dc10d","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-94fda718296d1f3696dc","layer":"original","quote":"时外兴军旅，内营宫室；劭作二赋，皆讽谏焉","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":348,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":52},{"id":"wangwei-q-6515567a79485a0664fd","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-3ac3e0851d07498d52be","layer":"original","quote":"劭议以为：“贼众新至，心专气锐。宠以少人自战其地，若便进击，不必能制〖15〗。宠求待兵，未有所失也。以为可先遣步兵五千，精骑三千，军前发〖16〗；扬声进道〖17〗，震曜形势。骑到合肥，疏其行队，多其旌鼓，曜兵城下；引出贼后，拟其归路〖18〗，要其粮道〖19〗。贼闻大军来，骑断其后；必震怖遁走，不战自破贼矣。”帝从之","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":349,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":57,"end":215},{"id":"wangwei-q-67eee6310dd58f120e12","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-512ad972d892624d9ffe","layer":"original","quote":"受诏集五经群书〖1〗，以类相从，作《皇览》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":345,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":35},{"id":"wangwei-q-760e096bcdcaafce2263","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-aeb0d2f31c6e13a1c11b","layer":"original","quote":"迁散骑常侍","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":66,"end":71},{"id":"wangwei-q-7631f01c01c5586a3a1b","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-94fda718296d1f3696dc","layer":"original","quote":"劭尝作《赵都赋》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":348,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8},{"id":"wangwei-q-7859a84f9e9a80eebe6d","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-4703372a524fd2d7cfdf","layer":"original","quote":"盖闻帝制宏深，圣道奥远；苟非其才，则道不虚行；神而明之，存乎其人。暨乎王略亏颓，而旷载罔缀〖7〗；微言既没〖8〗，六籍泯玷〖9〗。何则？道弘致远而众才莫晞也〖10〗。案劭《考课》论，虽欲寻前代黜陟之文〖11〗，然其制度略已阙亡〖12〗。礼之存者，惟有周典〖13〗：外建侯伯〖14〗，藩屏九服〖15〗；内立列司〖16〗，管齐六职〖17〗；土有恒贡，官有定则；百揆均任〖18〗，四民殊业〖19〗。故考绩可理而黜陟易通也〖20〗。","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":423,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":212},{"id":"wangwei-q-7e6618fac7cea14bb423","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-d33f91400c4f6f08fd14","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞臣松之以为：凡相称荐，率多溢美之辞，能不违中者或寡矣。惠之称劭，云“玄虚退让”及“明思通微”，近于过也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":385,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b014346488e0027f6317","start":0,"end":55},{"id":"wangwei-q-b3901ebc33d68bdf279d","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-e3933b3cde655110e1e9","layer":"original","quote":"劭以为：“昔袁尚兄弟归渊父康〖7〗，康斩送其首，是渊先世之效忠也。又所闻虚实，未可审知。古者要荒未服〖8〗，修德而不征，重劳民也〖9〗。宜加宽贷，使有以自新","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":347,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":29,"end":107},{"id":"wangwei-q-b3948054456e9a02124b","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-0a9703610a35d3f6a100","layer":"original","quote":"大魏继百王之末〖21〗，承秦、汉之烈〖22〗，制度之流，靡所修采〖23〗。自建安以来，至于青龙〖24〗；神武拨乱〖25〗，肇基皇祚〖26〗；扫除凶逆，芟夷遗寇；旌旗卷舒〖27〗，日不暇给〖28〗。及经邦治戎〖29〗，权法并用〖30〗；百官群司，军国通任；随时之宜，以应政机。以古施今〖31〗，事杂义殊〖32〗，难得而通也。所以然者，制宜经远〖33〗，或不切近；法应时务，不足垂后。夫建官均职，清理民物〖34〗，所以立本也；循名考实，纠励成规〖35〗，所以治末也。本纲未举而造制（未呈）〔末程〕〖36〗，国略不崇而考课是先〖37〗；惧不足以料贤愚之分，精幽明之理也。","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":424,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":282},{"id":"wangwei-q-cc6c045b0246bddb1720","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-aeb0d2f31c6e13a1c11b","layer":"original","quote":"与议郎庾嶷、荀诜等定科令〖4〗，作《新律》十八篇","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":31,"end":55},{"id":"wangwei-q-d4303d70b8c5f9cfaf98","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-aeb0d2f31c6e13a1c11b","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即位，出为陈留太守，敦崇教化，百姓称之","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":346,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wangwei-q-e325babcf0efe54f0d32","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-cf24c7d325b9a4032fe9","layer":"original","quote":"拜太子舍人","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":325,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":17,"end":22},{"id":"wangwei-q-f7f898633ddcf19f3513","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-15daacc36ba0bccaade6","layer":"original","quote":"又以为“宜制礼作乐，以移风俗”，著《乐论》十四篇；事成未上","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":387,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29},{"id":"wangwei-q-fdae8cb4d797349979cf","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-aa19c53218e540c9c8f9","layer":"original","quote":"正始中，执经讲学〖8〗，赐爵关内侯","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":388,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
